' ===== TEST EXECUTION SUMMARY =====
package "Complete Test Execution Summary" {
  note as N1
    **Test Execution Commands:**
    
    **Run All Use Case Tests:**
    npm test
    
    **Run Student Use Case Tests:**
    npm test -- --testNamePattern="Student"
    
    **Run Admin Use Case Tests:**
    npm test -- --testNamePattern="Admin"
    
    **Run Integration Tests:**
    npm test -- --testNamePattern="Integration"
    
    **Run with Coverage:**
    npm test -- --coverage
    
    **Run Tests in Watch Mode:**
    npm test -- --watch
  end note
  
  note as N2
    **Use Case Coverage Targets:**
    - Student Use Cases: 100%
    - Admin Use Cases: 100%
    - Use Case Relationships: 100%
    - Integration Flows: 100%
    
    **Test Categories:**
